Rule 3 (name should not be an operator spec or reduction keyword)
{v_3 : str} |= v_3 ≠ "ii" ∧ v_3 ≠ "ii->i" ∧ v_3 ≠ "i,j->ij" ∧ v_3 ≠ "bij,bjk->bik" ∧ v_3 ≠ "...ij->...ji" ∧ v_3 ≠ "bn,anm,bm->ba" ∧ v_3 ≠ "sum" ∧ v_3 ≠ "max" ∧ v_3 ≠ "min" ∧ v_3 ≠ "prod"
>>
Rule 4 (referenced shape dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, if ndim(v_1) = 0 then 0 else ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
